WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.210
Zippy spun his tires.

2
00:00:09.211 --> 00:00:12.173
He spun them very fast.

3
00:00:12.174 --> 00:00:15.002
Mud sprayed everywhere.

4
00:00:15.003 --> 00:00:18.087
But Zippy didn't move.

5
00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:24.272
Zippy sank deeper.

6
00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:28.585
"Help!" he cried.

7
00:00:28.586 --> 00:00:33.069
"I'll help you," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.336
The teacher pushed.

9
00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:40.293
Zippy moved a little bit.

10
00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:45.556
But then Mr. Grill sank too.

11
00:00:45.557 --> 00:00:52.293
"Help!" he cried.

12
00:00:52.294 --> 00:00:55.316
"Uh-oh!" said Dipper.

13
00:00:55.317 --> 00:00:58.385
Poppy gulped.

14
00:00:58.386 --> 00:01:00.970
Eddy looked at Jeb.

15
00:01:00.971 --> 00:01:04.998
Jeb looked at Eddy.

16
00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:09.643
"Let's clear that mud," said Eddy.

17
00:01:09.644 --> 00:01:13.465
The two friends moved fast.

18
00:01:13.466 --> 00:01:17.374
Shloomp! Jeb scooped the mud.

19
00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:38.571
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

20
00:01:38.572 --> 00:01:41.834
Soon everyone was free!

21
00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:45.042
"Thank you," said Mr. Grill.

22
00:01:45.043 --> 00:02:03.474
"You’re welcome," said Eddy and Jeb.

23
00:02:03.475 --> 00:02:07.063
Eddy zoomed along the path.

24
00:02:07.064 --> 00:02:19.549
"I love driving off-road!"

25
00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:26.662
Zippy groaned. "I don’t!"

